# Keep the Docker build context small and free of local state.
#
# The root context is only used by `Dockerfile.backend`, which copies
# `backend/requirements.txt`, `backend/alembic*` and `backend/app`. The frontend and
# bot build from their own directories, so their build contexts are governed by
# `frontend/.dockerignore` and `bot/.dockerignore`.
.git
.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.vscode
**/*.log
*.pem
*.key